els, and pagination.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Find Organization","d":"Find an organization by name","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Create Gist","d":"Create a gist from files","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Pull Request Opens or Closes","d":"Runs the workflow automatically whenever a pull request is opened or closed in the repository.","t":"trigger","k":"hook"},{"n":"Get File Changes","d":"Get file changes of a Pull Request","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Pull Requests","d":"List pull requests in a repository, optionally filtering by creation or update dates.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Get File Contents","d":"Retrieve a file's contents from a repository, optionally from a specific branch, tag, or commit.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Create Or Update File","d":"Add or update a file in repo","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"When a new comment is added to an issue","d":"Runs the workflow automatically whenever a new comment is added to any issue.","t":"trigger","k":"hook"},{"n":"Add Comment to Issue","d":"Add a comment to an issue","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Add Comment to Commit","d":"Post a comment on a specific commit in a repository, optionally targeting a file path and line position.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Create Inline Comment","d":"Create inline comment on PR","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"When a repository is forked","d":"Runs the workflow automatically whenever a repository is forked.","t":"trigger","k":"hook"},{"n":"When a new public repository is created","d":"Runs the workflow automatically whenever a new public repository is created in the account.","t":"trigger","k":"hook"},{"n":"List All Repository","d":"Retrieve all your repositories","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List PR Review Comments","d":"List PR review comments","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Get Pull Request Details","d":"Get full details for a specific pull request from a repository, optionally including reviews and review comments.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":